        <mxCell id="p-asIFV21MIEWjqzHZch-50" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;- POST /v1/URL -&amp;gt; short-url&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;{&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;apiDevKey,&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;longURL,&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;customeURL?,&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;expirationDate?&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;}&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;-GET /v1/URL/{short_url} -&amp;gt; LongURL&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="189" width="287" x="829" y="1340" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p-asIFV21MIEWjqzHZch-51" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;What kind of database should we use?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;Since we anticipate storing billions of rows, and we don’t&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;need to use relationships between objects – a NoSQL key-value store like &lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 109);&quot;&gt;DynamoDB&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 109);&quot;&gt;Cassandra&lt;/span&gt; or&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 109);&quot;&gt;Riak&lt;/span&gt; is a better choice. &lt;br&gt;A NoSQL choice would also be easier to scale.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="144" width="497" x="1517" y="1042" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p-asIFV21MIEWjqzHZch-52" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;For the GET API Status code can be 301,302 with the location header as longURL&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="64" width="201" x="1162" y="1340" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p-asIFV21MIEWjqzHZch-53" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;" value="&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;One thing worth discussing here is 301 redirect vs 302 redirect.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;301 redirect&lt;/b&gt;. A 301 redirect shows that the requested URL is “permanently” moved to the&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;long URL. Since it is permanently redirected, the browser caches the response, and&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;subsequent requests for the same URL will not be sent to the URL shortening service.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Instead, requests are redirected to the long URL server directly.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;302 redirect&lt;/b&gt;. A 302 redirect means that the URL is “temporarily” moved to the long URL,&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;meaning that subsequent requests for the same URL will be sent to the URL shortening&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;service first. Then, they are redirected to the long URL server.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Each redirection method has its pros and cons. If the priority is to reduce the server load,&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;using 301 redirect makes sense as only the first request of the same URL is sent to URL&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;shortening servers. However, if analytics is important, 302 redirect is a better choice as it can&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;track click rate and source of the click more easily.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="242" width="667" x="1400" y="1311" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p-asIFV21MIEWjqzHZch-54" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;6. High Level Design&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="255" x="357" y="1566" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
