        <mxCell id="p-asIFV21MIEWjqzHZch-67" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;URL Shortening&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;www.tinyUrl.com/{hashValue}&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left; margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;The hash function must satisfy the following requirements:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left; margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;• Each longURL must be hashed to one hashValue.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left; margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;• Each hashValue can be mapped back to the longURL.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="133" width="466" x="288" y="1774" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p-asIFV21MIEWjqzHZch-68" edge="1" parent="1" source="p-asIFV21MIEWjqzHZch-69" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;" target="p-asIFV21MIEWjqzHZch-71" value="">
