        <mxCell id="p-asIFV21MIEWjqzHZch-72" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;rounded=1;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;HashValue&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="120" x="1171" y="1790" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p-asIFV21MIEWjqzHZch-73" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Hash function&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;Hash function is used to hash a long URL to a short URL, also known as hashValue.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Hash value length&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;The hashValue consists of characters from [0-9, a-z, A-Z], containing 10 + 26 + 26 = 62&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;possible characters. To figure out the length of hashValue, find the smallest n such that 62^n&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;≥ 365 billion. We can assume 7 characters is enough&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="185" width="735" x="287" y="1945" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p-asIFV21MIEWjqzHZch-74" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;Method 1&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;Encoding Actual URL&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;We can compute Unique Hash(MD5,SHA 256).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;BY MD5 Algorithm we will get 128-bit Hash Value and even After base 62 encoding It will have more than 21 characters&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;Since We have only 7 Characters per short key .&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;- We can take first 7 Characters (This could result in key duplication though)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;WorkAround&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;To resolve hash collisions, we can recursively append a new&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;predefined string until no more collision is discovered.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;This method can eliminate collision; however, it is expensive to query the database to check&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;if a shortURL exists for every request. &lt;b&gt;A technique called bloom filters&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;can improve&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;performance. A bloom filter is a space-efficient probabilistic technique to test if an element is&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;a member of a set.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="361" width="742" x="288" y="2263" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
